OL,3,GNEWSAThousands still without power
OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo batters Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes across Scotland
OL,7,Fremain without power while the Met
OL,8,FOffice has issued a new weather warning
OL,9,Fin the aftermath of Storm Boelo.
OL,11,FA 60-year-old man died as the second
OL,12,Fnamed storm in a matter of days brought
OL,13,Fheavy flooding and wind gusts in some
OL,14,Fareas of up to 85mph (137km/h).
OL,16,FRichard Baines, the long-serving
OL,17,Fcurator of Logan Botanic Garden near
OL,18,FStranraer, is understood to have been
OL,19,Fwalking near his home in Mid Kelton,
OL,20,Fjust outside Castle Douglas, when he
OL,21,Fwas hit by a falling tree.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
